            "contentId": "Loop2_1_Start_node_1_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Wh… what’s going on?",
                "zh": "怎...怎么回事？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 649.3333740234375,
            "positionY": 288.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e551df73-976c-4d31-969c-8ebc1dc72ada",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_Start_node_2_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "(The lights are back. And the flight attendant… she looks totally normal.)",
                "zh": "（灯光是亮着的，乘务员小姐看上去也很正常。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1014.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 288.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "12c191a5-1eda-4925-9dd7-5b3fed318129",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_Start_node_3_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Was that… just a nightmare?",
                "zh": "是我做了噩梦？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1385.333251953125,
            "positionY": 288.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c21573c7-16fe-4fa7-b10f-d1d3a998b828",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "03fbd1fc-0e37-4fb2-abea-a8bb2982cffb",
            "contentId": "Loop2_1_Start_node_4_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "(But those faces… that pain… it all felt too real. I can still feel it. Can something like that really be just a dream?)",
                "zh": "（可那些人的脸，还有那种疼痛......太真实了，我现在都还忘不掉，这难道全部都是梦吗？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1748.0,
            "positionY": 288.6666564941406,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
